EmitBlockGuardModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: EmitBlockGuard — guard condition computation for EmitBlock

    Function
        Name: EmitBlockGuard
        Params: state, bid
        Returns: res (map with state, skip)

    DependsOn
        ComputeChains, InList

    Reads
        state["chains"], state["bm"], state["emitted"]

    Writes
        state["chains"] (if computed)

    Behavior
        Step 1: If state["chains"] == null, calls ComputeChains(state["bm"])
        Step 2: Checks bid == null or bid in emitted
        Step 3: Returns {state: updated_state, skip: bool}

    Notes
        Block emission steps 1-2 (guard computation)
